==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{af|ru|смота́ть|-ся}}.

Compare typologically {{m+|en|went}} (simple past of {{m|en|go}}, simple past and past participle of {{m|en|wend}}, akin to {{m|en|wind}}).

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|смота́ться}}

===Verb===
{{ru-verb|смота́ться|pf|impf=сма́тываться}}

# {{lb|ru|low colloquial}} to [[leave]], to [[scram]], to [[skedaddle]], to [[vamoose]]
#: {{syn|ru|умота́ть}}
# {{infl of|ru|смота́ть||pass}}

====Conjugation====
{{ru-conj|pf|1a|смота́ться}}

